@page "/"
@using EventSourcingCqrs.Hosts.Web.Components.Layout

<PageTitle>Orders workspace</PageTitle>

<section class="workspace-hero" aria-labelledby="workspace-heading">
    <div class="workspace-hero-copy">
        <p class="workspace-eyebrow"><span class="workspace-little-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> A fresh page for your next order</p>
        <h1 id="workspace-heading">Every order<br />has a <em>story.</em></h1>
        <p class="workspace-hero-description">From the first item to a change of plans. Bring your orders, stock, and all the little details together.</p>
        <div class="workspace-hero-actions">
            <a href="/orders/new" class="workspace-button workspace-button-ink">Create an order <WorkspaceIcon Name="arrow" /></a>
            <a href="/orders" class="workspace-text-link">Browse orders <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="workspace-hero-footnote"><span class="workspace-sticker-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Big plans. Small details. All in one place.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="workspace-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="workspace-art-orbit"></span>
        <img src="/illustrations/parcel-studio.svg?v=20261007-studio" width="500" height="420" alt="" class="workspace-parcel-art" />
        <span class="workspace-hero-sticker">A little<br /><strong>possibility.</strong><span>↗</span></span>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="workspace-task-section" aria-labelledby="tasks-heading">
    <div class="workspace-section-heading"><div><p class="workspace-eyebrow">Pick your next move</p><h2 id="tasks-heading">Let’s get into it.</h2></div><span class="workspace-section-doodle" aria-hidden="true">↘</span></div>
    <div class="workspace-task-grid">
        <a href="/orders" class="workspace-task-card workspace-task-lilac"><span class="workspace-task-top"><span class="workspace-task-icon"><WorkspaceIcon Name="orders" /></span><span class="workspace-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><h3>Review orders</h3><p>The big picture, and every little detail. Open an order and follow its story.</p><span class="workspace-task-caption">THE ORDER BOOK</span></a>
        <a href="/my-orders" class="workspace-task-card workspace-task-peach"><span class="workspace-task-top"><span class="workspace-task-icon"><WorkspaceIcon Name="person" /></span><span class="workspace-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><h3>My orders</h3><p>Your corner of the workspace. Find the orders available to your account.</p><span class="workspace-task-caption">YOUR OWN LITTLE CORNER</span></a>
        <a href="/inventory" class="workspace-task-card workspace-task-lime"><span class="workspace-task-top"><span class="workspace-task-icon"><WorkspaceIcon Name="inventory" /></span><span class="workspace-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><h3>Manage inventory</h3><p>A home for what’s on the shelf. Check quantities and keep your stock in order.</p><span class="workspace-task-caption">ROOM ON THE SHELF</span></a>
        <a href="/admin/throughput" class="workspace-task-card workspace-task-blue"><span class="workspace-task-top"><span class="workspace-task-icon"><WorkspaceIcon Name="pulse" /></span><span class="workspace-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><h3>Order activity</h3><p>See the pace of recent order changes and the latest reported update.</p><span class="workspace-task-caption">FEEL THE RHYTHM</span></a>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="order-walkthrough" aria-labelledby="walkthrough-heading" class="workspace-walkthrough">
    <div class="workspace-walkthrough-heading"><span class="workspace-walkthrough-icon" aria-hidden="true"><WorkspaceIcon Name="clock" /></span><div><p class="workspace-eyebrow">Give the story a plot twist</p><h2 id="walkthrough-heading">Plans change. The history stays.</h2><p>Try an order of your own, then revisit the moments that made it.</p></div></div>
    <ol class="workspace-walkthrough-steps">
        <li><span class="workspace-step-number">01</span><h3>Create an order</h3><p>Add a customer, an available item, and somewhere to send it.</p><a href="/orders/new">Create an order <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
        <li><span class="workspace-step-number">02</span><h3>Place it</h3><p>Check the details and place it. The order page follows what happens next.</p></li>
        <li><span class="workspace-step-number">03</span><h3>Change your mind</h3><p>Cancel while cancellation is available. Wait for the status to update.</p></li>
        <li><span class="workspace-step-number">04</span><h3>Revisit its history</h3><p>Open View order history. Compare the placed and cancelled steps side by side.</p><a href="/orders">Find your order <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
    </ol>
</section>
